<title>USA: Schering-Plough Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Schering-Plough Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, N.J. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.76		    $0.66</p>
<p> Net		 277,400		  239,400</p>
<p> Sales	     1,414,300		1,290,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  n/a			n/a</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $3.30		    $2.40</p>
<p> Net		 1,212,800		886,600</p>
<p> Revs		5,655,800		5,104,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  367,700		  364,200</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: The company said foreign exchange had a negative effect of about one percent on the 1996 full year and fourth quarter results.</p>
